The upstream repository declares the MIT model license. Dataset terms and
attribution remain separate and are summarized below; no model weights or
training audio are redistributed with Visual Nerve. Selected weights are
downloaded only at an explicit user request from these pinned source URLs.
Visual Nerve does not retrain or modify these voice models.

LibriTTS uses only its fixed upstream speaker ID 0 (p3922). The underlying
model contains 904 speakers; this catalog does not offer arbitrary selection.
Jenny (Dioco) is Irish. The upstream model is categorized as en_GB; this
regional catalog code is not a claim that the voice has a British accent.

